  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Thread chicken, onion, and bell pepper onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Brush skewers with marinade, making sure to coat all pieces evenly.",
